{"id":79,"slug":"79-inheritance-trong-css-la-gi","category":"CSS","subcategory":"Nhập Môn","level":"beginner","question_vi":"Inheritance trong CSS là gì?","question_en":"What is inheritance in CSS?","answer_vi":"Một số thuộc tính CSS **tự truyền xuống element con**, số còn lại thì không.\n\n```css\nbody { color: #333; font-family: system-ui; }\n/* mọi <p>, <span>, <li> bên trong đều nhận — không cần khai báo lại */\n\n.card { border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 16px; }\n/* con của .card KHÔNG có border hay padding */\n```\n\n| Kế thừa | Không kế thừa |\n|---|---|\n| `color`, `font-*`, `line-height`, `letter-spacing` | `margin`, `padding`, `border`, `background` |\n| `text-align`, `visibility`, `cursor`, `list-style` | `width`, `height`, `display`, `position` |\n\nQuy luật chung: thuộc tính về **chữ** thì kế thừa, thuộc tính về **hộp** thì không.\n\nBốn từ khoá điều khiển:\n\n```css\n.child {\n  color: inherit;   /* ép lấy của cha, kể cả khi vốn không kế thừa */\n  border: initial;  /* về giá trị mặc định của spec */\n  margin: unset;    /* = inherit nếu thuộc tính kế thừa, ngược lại = initial */\n  all: revert;      /* về giá trị của browser stylesheet */\n}\n```\n\n**Lưu ý:** `<button>`, `<input>`, `<textarea>` **không kế thừa `font`** từ cha vì browser stylesheet đặt sẵn font riêng. Reset thủ công là việc gần như dự án nào cũng phải làm:\n\n```css\nbutton, input, select, textarea { font: inherit; }\n```","answer_en":"Some CSS properties **flow down to descendants** automatically; the rest do not.\n\n```css\nbody { color: #333; font-family: system-ui; }\n/* every <p>, <span>, <li> inside picks it up — no need to repeat it */\n\n.card { border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 16px; }\n/* children of .card get NO border or padding */\n```\n\n| Inherited | Not inherited |\n|---|---|\n| `color`, `font-*`, `line-height`, `letter-spacing` | `margin`, `padding`, `border`, `background` |\n| `text-align`, `visibility`, `cursor`, `list-style` | `width`, `height`, `display`, `position` |\n\nRule of thumb: **text** properties inherit, **box** properties do not.\n\nFour controlling keywords:\n\n```css\n.child {\n  color: inherit;   /* force the parent value, even for non-inherited properties */\n  border: initial;  /* the spec's default value */\n  margin: unset;    /* = inherit for inherited properties, else = initial */\n  all: revert;      /* back to the browser stylesheet value */\n}\n```\n\n**Note:** `<button>`, `<input>` and `<textarea>` **do not inherit `font`**, because the browser stylesheet sets their own. Resetting it by hand is something nearly every project ends up doing:\n\n```css\nbutton, input, select, textarea { font: inherit; }\n```","answer_html_vi":"<p>Một số thuộc tính CSS <strong>tự truyền xuống element con</strong>, số còn lại thì không.</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">css</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"body { color: #333; font-family: system-ui; }\n/* mọi &lt;p&gt;, &lt;span&gt;, &lt;li&gt; bên trong đều nhận — không cần khai báo lại */\n\n.card { border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 16px; }\n/* con của .card KHÔNG có border hay padding */\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-selector-tag\">body</span> { <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">color</span>: <span class=\"hljs-number\">#333</span>; <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">font-family</span>: system-ui; }\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">/* mọi &lt;p&gt;, &lt;span&gt;, &lt;li&gt; bên trong đều nhận — không cần khai báo lại */</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-selector-class\">.card</span> { <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">border</span>: <span class=\"hljs-number\">1px</span> solid <span class=\"hljs-number\">#ddd</span>; <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">padding</span>: <span class=\"hljs-number\">16px</span>; }\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">/* con của .card KHÔNG có border hay padding */</span></code></pre></div><div class=\"qa-table-wrap\"><table class=\"qa-table\"><thead><tr><th>Kế thừa</th><th>Không kế thừa</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>color</code>, <code>font-*</code>, <code>line-height</code>, <code>letter-spacing</code></td><td><code>margin</code>, <code>padding</code>, <code>border</code>, <code>background</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>text-align</code>, <code>visibility</code>, <code>cursor</code>, <code>list-style</code></td><td><code>width</code>, <code>height</code>, <code>display</code>, <code>position</code></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class=\"qa-summary\">Quy luật chung: thuộc tính về <strong>chữ</strong> thì kế thừa, thuộc tính về <strong>hộp</strong> thì không.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\">Bốn từ khoá điều khiển:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">css</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\".child {\n  color: inherit;   /* ép lấy của cha, kể cả khi vốn không kế thừa */\n  border: initial;  /* về giá trị mặc định của spec */\n  margin: unset;    /* = inherit nếu thuộc tính kế thừa, ngược lại = initial */\n  all: revert;      /* về giá trị của browser stylesheet */\n}\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-selector-class\">.child</span> {\n  <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">color</span>: inherit;   <span class=\"hljs-comment\">/* ép lấy của cha, kể cả khi vốn không kế thừa */</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">border</span>: initial;  <span class=\"hljs-comment\">/* về giá trị mặc định của spec */</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">margin</span>: unset;    <span class=\"hljs-comment\">/* = inherit nếu thuộc tính kế thừa, ngược lại = initial */</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">all</span>: revert;      <span class=\"hljs-comment\">/* về giá trị của browser stylesheet */</span>\n}</code></pre></div><p class=\"qa-summary\"><strong>Lưu ý:</strong> <code>&lt;button&gt;</code>, <code>&lt;input&gt;</code>, <code>&lt;textarea&gt;</code> <strong>không kế thừa <code>font</code></strong> từ cha vì browser stylesheet đặt sẵn font riêng.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\">Reset thủ công là việc gần như dự án nào cũng phải làm:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">css</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"button, input, select, textarea { font: inherit; }\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-selector-tag\">button</span>, <span class=\"hljs-selector-tag\">input</span>, <span class=\"hljs-selector-tag\">select</span>, <span class=\"hljs-selector-tag\">textarea</span> { <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">font</span>: inherit; }</code></pre></div>","answer_html_en":"<p>Some CSS properties <strong>flow down to descendants</strong> automatically; the rest do not.</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">css</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"body { color: #333; font-family: system-ui; }\n/* every &lt;p&gt;, &lt;span&gt;, &lt;li&gt; inside picks it up — no need to repeat it */\n\n.card { border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 16px; }\n/* children of .card get NO border or padding */\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-selector-tag\">body</span> { <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">color</span>: <span class=\"hljs-number\">#333</span>; <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">font-family</span>: system-ui; }\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">/* every &lt;p&gt;, &lt;span&gt;, &lt;li&gt; inside picks it up — no need to repeat it */</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-selector-class\">.card</span> { <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">border</span>: <span class=\"hljs-number\">1px</span> solid <span class=\"hljs-number\">#ddd</span>; <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">padding</span>: <span class=\"hljs-number\">16px</span>; }\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">/* children of .card get NO border or padding */</span></code></pre></div><div class=\"qa-table-wrap\"><table class=\"qa-table\"><thead><tr><th>Inherited</th><th>Not inherited</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>color</code>, <code>font-*</code>, <code>line-height</code>, <code>letter-spacing</code></td><td><code>margin</code>, <code>padding</code>, <code>border</code>, <code>background</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>text-align</code>, <code>visibility</code>, <code>cursor</code>, <code>list-style</code></td><td><code>width</code>, <code>height</code>, <code>display</code>, <code>position</code></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class=\"qa-summary\">Rule of thumb: <strong>text</strong> properties inherit, <strong>box</strong> properties do not.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\">Four controlling keywords:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">css</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\".child {\n  color: inherit;   /* force the parent value, even for non-inherited properties */\n  border: initial;  /* the spec's default value */\n  margin: unset;    /* = inherit for inherited properties, else = initial */\n  all: revert;      /* back to the browser stylesheet value */\n}\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-selector-class\">.child</span> {\n  <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">color</span>: inherit;   <span class=\"hljs-comment\">/* force the parent value, even for non-inherited properties */</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">border</span>: initial;  <span class=\"hljs-comment\">/* the spec&#x27;s default value */</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">margin</span>: unset;    <span class=\"hljs-comment\">/* = inherit for inherited properties, else = initial */</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">all</span>: revert;      <span class=\"hljs-comment\">/* back to the browser stylesheet value */</span>\n}</code></pre></div><p class=\"qa-summary\"><strong>Note:</strong> <code>&lt;button&gt;</code>, <code>&lt;input&gt;</code> and <code>&lt;textarea&gt;</code> <strong>do not inherit <code>font</code></strong>, because the browser stylesheet sets their own.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\">Resetting it by hand is something nearly every project ends up doing:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">css</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"button, input, select, textarea { font: inherit; }\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-selector-tag\">button</span>, <span class=\"hljs-selector-tag\">input</span>, <span class=\"hljs-selector-tag\">select</span>, <span class=\"hljs-selector-tag\">textarea</span> { <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">font</span>: inherit; }</code></pre></div>","references":[{"label":"MDN — Inheritance","url":"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/CSS_cascade/Inheritance"},{"label":"MDN — unset","url":"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/unset"}],"related":[{"url":"/q/77-cascade-trong-css-nghia-la-gi","title":"Cascade trong CSS nghĩa là gì?"},{"url":"/q/80-don-vi-px-em-rem-vw-vh-khac-nhau","title":"Đơn vị px, em, rem, %, vw, vh khác nhau?"},{"url":"/q/81-important-dung-khi-nao-tai-sao-nen-tranh","title":"!important dùng khi nào? Tại sao nên tránh?"},{"url":"/q/87-has-selector-la-gi","title":":has() selector là gì?"},{"url":"/q/88-combinator-selectors-space-khac-nhau","title":"Combinator selectors (>, +, ~, space) khác nhau?"},{"url":"/q/90-is-where-not-khac-nhau","title":":is(), :where(), :not() khác nhau?"},{"url":"/q/91-box-model-gom-nhung-gi","title":"Box model gồm những gì?"},{"url":"/q/92-box-sizi